#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pengantar"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the previous lesson, we took a first look at quantum error correction, focusing specifically on the 9-qubit Shor code.\n"
"In this lesson, we'll introduce the *stabilizer formalism*, which is a mathematical framework through which a broad class of quantum error correcting codes, known as *stabilizer codes*, can be specified and analyzed.\n"
"This includes the 9-qubit Shor code along with many other examples, including codes that seem likely to be well-suited to real-world quantum devices.\n"
"Not every quantum error correcting code is a stabilizer code, but many are, including every example that we'll see in this course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di pelajaran sebelumnya, kita sudah melihat pertama kali koreksi kesalahan kuantum, dengan fokus khusus pada kode Shor 9-qubit.\n"
"Di pelajaran ini, kita akan memperkenalkan *formalisme stabilizer*, yaitu kerangka matematis yang memungkinkan kelas luas kode koreksi kesalahan kuantum, yang dikenal sebagai *kode stabilizer*, bisa dispesifikasi dan dianalisis.\n"
"Ini termasuk kode Shor 9-qubit beserta banyak contoh lainnya, termasuk kode yang tampaknya cocok untuk perangkat kuantum di dunia nyata.\n"
"Tidak semua kode koreksi kesalahan kuantum adalah kode stabilizer, tapi banyak yang memang demikian, termasuk semua contoh yang akan kita lihat di kursus ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The lesson begins with a short discussion of Pauli matrices, and tensor products of Pauli matrices more generally, which can represent not only operations on qubits, but also measurements of qubits — in which case they're typically referred to as *observables*.\n"
"We'll then go back and take a second look at the repetition code and see how it can be described in terms of Pauli matrix observables.\n"
"This will both inform and lead into a general discussion of stabilizer codes, including several examples, basic properties of stabilizer codes, and how the fundamental tasks of encoding, detecting errors, and correcting those errors can be performed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelajaran dimulai dengan diskusi singkat tentang matriks Pauli, dan produk tensor dari matriks Pauli secara umum, yang bisa merepresentasikan bukan hanya operasi pada qubit, tapi juga pengukuran qubit — dalam hal ini biasanya disebut sebagai *observable*.\n"
"Kita kemudian akan kembali dan melihat kedua kalinya kode repetisi serta melihat bagaimana kode itu bisa dijelaskan dalam bentuk observable matriks Pauli.\n"
"Ini akan menginformasikan dan mengarah ke diskusi umum tentang kode stabilizer, termasuk beberapa contoh, properti dasar kode stabilizer, dan bagaimana tugas fundamental encoding, mendeteksi kesalahan, serta mengoreksi kesalahan tersebut bisa dilakukan.\n"

